Run `verify.sh` or inspect deployment:
```bash
kubectl get deployment api-server
```
Expected Output:
```
NAME         READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE
api-server   1/1     1            1           5m
```
The pod `api-server-*` must show `READY 1/1` and status `Running` with zero `CreateContainerConfigError` occurrences.
